1
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:18,260
Qi Fengyin,

2
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,100
are you all right?

3
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,770
I'm not dying yet.

4
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:23,610
My Lord,

5
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,380
you nearly killed us just now.

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,610
Qi Fengyin!

7
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,140
What's wrong with him?

8
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:41,630
His Lordship is fine.

9
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,600
But what happened to you?

10
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,720
You vanished

11
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,460
without a word!

12
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,870
Yamao and I looked everywhere for you.

13
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,630
We were worried sick.

14
00:00:46,630 --> 00:00:47,290
What if something

15
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:48,420
had happened to you?

16
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,330
I went to look for this.

17
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:52,690
Duyao,

18
00:00:53,030 --> 00:00:53,540
I'm sorry.

19
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:54,970
I...

20
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,780
Now that we have this,

21
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:58,580
can we save your master?

22
00:01:08,190 --> 00:01:09,620
The ritual to repair the talisman

23
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:10,760
was abruptly interrupted.

24
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,510
Now,

25
00:01:11,750 --> 00:01:13,090
we can't fully repair it.

26
00:01:14,110 --> 00:01:15,700
Let's wait for Qi Fengyin to recover first.

27
00:01:16,030 --> 00:01:16,620
All right.

28
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:18,450
But His Lordship

29
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:20,340
seems to be getting worse and worse.

30
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:36,680
It's the mark from the black dragon's fang.

31
00:01:40,330 --> 00:01:41,810
I knew something was wrong with him just now.

32
00:01:42,360 --> 00:01:43,550
So the venom's to blame.

33
00:01:44,990 --> 00:01:46,010
But why

34
00:01:46,670 --> 00:01:47,810
is it only taking effect now?

35
00:01:48,390 --> 00:01:48,890
Yamao,

36
00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,620
what can we do

37
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,060
to neutralize the venom?

38
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:23,860
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

39
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:31,860
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

40
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:37,140
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

41
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:48,380
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

42
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:55,500
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

43
00:02:56,740 --> 00:03:03,380
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

44
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:11,420
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

45
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:19,540
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

46
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:26,100
[Blossom in Darkness]

47
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,100
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

48
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:31,100
[Episode 15]

49
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,180
Hold on to me tight.

50
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,380
Don't let go, all right?

51
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:43,090
Until the venom is fully neutralized,

52
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:43,970
you mustn't

53
00:03:43,970 --> 00:03:44,960
take the blindfold off either.

54
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,660
Why do I need a blindfold?

55
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,890
You said that when you opened your eyes,

56
00:03:50,150 --> 00:03:51,500
your recent memories would merge

57
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,100
with memories from 1,000 years ago.

58
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,980
I'm afraid you won't be able to take it

59
00:03:55,190 --> 00:03:55,940
and will lose control again.

60
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:56,780
After all,

61
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:58,540
you can't handle anything upsetting right now.

62
00:03:59,310 --> 00:04:00,540
The black dragon's venom

63
00:04:00,910 --> 00:04:02,500
seems to hold memories from 1,000 years ago.

64
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,130
I just don't understand

65
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:06,610
why it's only taking effect now.

66
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,500
I can't figure it out either.

67
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,380
Did you do something

68
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,010
that made the venom spread?

69
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:28,580
Could it have something to do with how I felt then?

70
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,100
We're here.

71
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:45,080
This is a cold spring

72
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,380
on the hill out back of Mount Zhaowu.

73
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:47,850
With Wuchang Prison right behind it,

74
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,210
the water's icy cold.

75
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,100
It's just

76
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:51,650
what you need to calm your mind.

77
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:54,650
All right. Come on. Take off your clothes.

78
00:04:56,670 --> 00:04:57,490
Take off my clothes?

79
00:04:58,350 --> 00:04:58,890
No.

80
00:05:00,190 --> 00:05:00,690
Why not?

81
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:03,690
How...

82
00:05:03,910 --> 00:05:05,460
How can you soak in all those clothes?

83
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:11,530
Don't tell me you're feeling shy.

84
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,380
Turn around.

85
00:05:55,270 --> 00:05:56,460
How long do I have to soak here?

86
00:06:01,270 --> 00:06:02,170
About

87
00:06:02,910 --> 00:06:03,770
two hours.

88
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:05,820
I've written out a prescription.

89
00:06:06,070 --> 00:06:06,690
Youyou and Duyao

90
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:07,690
have split up to gather the herbs.

91
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:08,820
None of them are rare.

92
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:10,280
There are just a lot of different kinds.

93
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,940
Once I've made the remedy,

94
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,940
I'll help you break down the venom

95
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,330
until it's completely neutralized.

96
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,380
Then I'll repair the Demon Soul Talisman

97
00:06:23,150 --> 00:06:24,130
and save your master.

98
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,020
Yamao

99
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:40,580
sent Duyao and me

100
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,570
to gather herbs separately.

101
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:43,690
I bet she just wanted a moment alone

102
00:06:43,710 --> 00:06:45,100
with His Lordship at the cold spring.

103
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:50,060
[Carpesium; Wormwood from Jiangning Prefecture]

104
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,460
Found it.

105
00:07:00,710 --> 00:07:02,240
I can't believe that after 1,000 years,

106
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,520
my talisman's still around.

107
00:07:04,430 --> 00:07:05,780
Once His Lordship repairs it,

108
00:07:06,150 --> 00:07:06,780
I'll find a chance

109
00:07:07,030 --> 00:07:08,180
to snatch it back from Yamao.

110
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:13,900
After all,

111
00:07:14,270 --> 00:07:15,660
it's mine to begin with.

112
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:17,180
I'm just

113
00:07:17,820 --> 00:07:18,800
taking back what's mine.

114
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:31,850
Who's there?

115
00:08:00,990 --> 00:08:03,300
You kicked me when I was down last time.

116
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,010
Now it's my turn to get even.

117
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,500
I didn't know

118
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:31,960
Mount Zhaowu had venomous sand wasps.

119
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,730
Even with his spells to protect him,

120
00:08:36,430 --> 00:08:37,500
he's in for a nasty time.

121
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,540
Help!

122
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:55,530
Help!

123
00:08:55,530 --> 00:08:56,240
Go away!

124
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,420
Help!

125
00:08:57,970 --> 00:08:58,340
Help...

126
00:08:58,710 --> 00:08:59,370
Go away! Shoo!

127
00:08:59,370 --> 00:09:00,050
Help!

128
00:09:00,710 --> 00:09:01,740
Go away!

129
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,820
Come on!

130
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,300
Wait! My... My foot's been stung!

131
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,250
I'll carry you!

132
00:09:38,470 --> 00:09:38,860
Why didn't you

133
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:40,510
kill all those venomous sand wasps?

134
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,570
They really hold a grudge.

135
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,380
Once they find an enemy,

136
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,500
they'll never stop hounding them.

137
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,900
All creatures around Mount Zhaowu

138
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:47,500
are sentient beings.

139
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:48,770
We mustn't kill needlessly.

140
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,420
There's spiritual power in their stingers.

141
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:58,180
You're a demon,

142
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,090
so the stings

143
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,890
hurt you more than they would an ordinary person.

144
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:05,770
Every time I run into you, something goes wrong.

145
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,330
I swear you're

146
00:10:07,350 --> 00:10:08,380
the world's biggest jinx!

147
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:09,860
From now on,

148
00:10:10,110 --> 00:10:11,090
I'm staying well away from you!

149
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:14,860
Are you laughing at me?

150
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:16,980
Fine, you're right.

151
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,980
It's all my fault you got stung.

152
00:10:19,590 --> 00:10:21,010
I tricked you into poking the hive

153
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:22,210
and got venomous wasps after you.

154
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:25,050
So, to make it up to you,

155
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,450
I'll treat your wounds, all right?

156
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,270
Once I get the talisman back and become

157
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:18,530
a mighty demon again,

158
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,540
I'll tear you limb from limb.

159
00:11:29,390 --> 00:11:30,850
Even if the talisman is repaired

160
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:32,940
and Danshen comes back to life,

161
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:34,850
neither of you

162
00:11:34,870 --> 00:11:35,730
is going anywhere.

163
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:36,820
I know.

164
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:38,580
I can't leave until your mystical flower blooms.

165
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:39,820
Don't worry.

166
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,980
I won't leave with my master

167
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,460
until you've had your revenge.

168
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:44,770
I won't allow it.

169
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,440
Since when do I need your permission

170
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,940
to be with my master?

171
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,700
What are you sulking about now?

172
00:12:07,150 --> 00:12:08,610
You brought it up first.

173
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,010
When Master wakes up,

174
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,120
if he learns about what I've done

175
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,300
to the immortal sects

176
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,730
and about my relationship with Qi Fengyin,

177
00:12:33,390 --> 00:12:34,650
will he be angry?

178
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:36,010
Senior Brother Lu,

179
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,010
you first.

180
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,730
After you, Junior Brother Li.

181
00:12:47,200 --> 00:12:47,780
Senior Brother Lu,

182
00:12:47,990 --> 00:12:48,730
after you.

183
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:51,090
After you, Junior Brother Li.

184
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,490
You're my senior brother. You first.

185
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,220
You first, please.

186
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:55,890
After you.

187
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:11,770
Yamao,

188
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,010
my blindfold's wet.

189
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,220
That's all you have to say?

190
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:19,250
Go get me a dry one.

191
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:22,650
Qi Fengyin!

192
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:24,180
You blockhead!

193
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:25,220
You don't understand a thing!

194
00:14:42,790 --> 00:14:43,770
It's dark now.

195
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:49,460
Be patient.

196
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:52,010
It needs a little more time to heal.

197
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:16,820
Next time you get angry,

198
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:17,940
just come

199
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,250
and beat me up.

200
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:20,980
Don't provoke those venomous wasps again.

201
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,220
You'd only hurt yourself

202
00:15:22,630 --> 00:15:24,100
more than the person you're after.

203
00:15:32,270 --> 00:15:32,890
Don't cry.

204
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,530
I wasn't trying to make fun of you.

205
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:44,650
You know I'm a demon.

206
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:46,370
Why are you helping me?

207
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:47,960
Are you trying to use me

208
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,580
to find Qi Fengyin?

209
00:15:50,030 --> 00:15:51,420
- Of course not. I... - Forget it.

210
00:15:51,890 --> 00:15:52,420
Forget I asked.

211
00:15:53,270 --> 00:15:54,660
I couldn't care less

212
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:55,650
what any of you think anyway.

213
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,820
You sect lackeys are all the same.

214
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:01,980
What?

215
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,770
The venomous sand wasps outside are gone.

216
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:14,060
Yes.

217
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,420
At night...

218
00:16:45,910 --> 00:16:46,700
I'll never trust

219
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,770
you sect lackeys.

220
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:09,660
You've got the talisman.

221
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,090
Why are you still on Mount Zhaowu?

222
00:17:14,790 --> 00:17:16,700
Are those all for Qi Fengyin?

223
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,900
I won't let you take them.

224
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:23,730
Mount Zhaowu's dispensary

225
00:17:24,270 --> 00:17:25,250
won't even look twice

226
00:17:25,270 --> 00:17:25,980
at these useless herbs.

227
00:17:26,350 --> 00:17:27,530
Why would I want them?

228
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:31,140
I'm here to remind you

229
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:33,090
that my master brought you to life

230
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,420
from one of his artifacts.

231
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:37,050
You should be on Mount Zhaowu's side.

232
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:39,700
Choose the right side while you still can.

233
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:41,810
If you stay with Qi Fengyin,

234
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:44,490
you won't have long to live.

235
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:46,380
Even if all the immortal sects joined forces,

236
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,900
they'd still be no match for my brother.

237
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:50,090
The Five Great Sects and all the rest

238
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,770
are indeed no match for Qi Fengyin.

239
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,660
But Mount Zhaowu

240
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:57,050
has a weapon of immense power.

241
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,010
Once awakened,

242
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,160
it can easily reduce Qi Fengyin

243
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,220
to dust.

244
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:04,660
Stay with him,

245
00:18:05,370 --> 00:18:06,660
and you'll only end up

246
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:08,330
dying with him.

247
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,290
I... I don't believe you.

248
00:18:13,030 --> 00:18:14,940
To live or to die,

249
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:16,860
it's up to you.

250
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,490
What will your choice be?

251
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:35,660
Hungry?

252
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,140
Yamao,

253
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,220
are you angry

254
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,900
because it's improper for men and women to touch?

255
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:51,220
So you do remember

256
00:18:51,510 --> 00:18:52,330
what I taught you.

257
00:19:00,750 --> 00:19:01,940
I can do right by you.

258
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,770
I can marry you.

259
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:15,980
Are you listening?

260
00:19:17,750 --> 00:19:18,580
Has the venom

261
00:19:18,580 --> 00:19:19,530
messed with your head?

262
00:19:19,530 --> 00:19:20,130
I know

263
00:19:20,130 --> 00:19:21,420
exactly what I'm saying.

264
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:24,940
If we get married,

265
00:19:25,590 --> 00:19:26,900
then the next time this happens,

266
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:29,730
you won't need to get angry with me.

267
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:33,980
Getting married

268
00:19:34,270 --> 00:19:34,820
isn't

269
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:36,300
about making it easier to stay together.

270
00:19:36,550 --> 00:19:38,090
You have to share a deep bond

271
00:19:38,370 --> 00:19:39,660
and love each other.

272
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,180
You don't even understand love yet,

273
00:19:42,750 --> 00:19:43,940
and you don't have a thread of fate.

274
00:19:44,750 --> 00:19:45,570
So forget it.

275
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:50,900
Yamao,

276
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:55,140
I don't want to let you go

277
00:19:57,550 --> 00:19:58,730
even after the flower blooms.

278
00:20:19,810 --> 00:20:21,120
Don't you think

279
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,740
things have been a little strange

280
00:20:22,950 --> 00:20:24,360
since he got back?

281
00:20:31,550 --> 00:20:32,180
Youyou,

282
00:20:33,670 --> 00:20:35,120
have you heard

283
00:20:36,920 --> 00:20:38,530
about that powerful weapon

284
00:20:38,530 --> 00:20:39,620
enshrined at Mount Zhaowu?

285
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:41,570
I heard

286
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,940
that once it's awakened,

287
